  "name": "cluster_density_anchor",
  "intent": "Anchors priority on nearest-neighbor distance but boosts candidates with high cluster_density (dense local neighborhoods) and penalizes high spread (irregular neighbor distances). This favors traversal of tight, regular clusters that 2-opt can efficiently untangle, avoiding loose jumps while exploiting spatial coherence.",
